      "text": "Our work focuses on Tree-RAG (Liu et al , 2021; Jin et al , 2025b; Sarthi et al , 2024; Tao et al , 2025; Rezazadeh et al , 2025), which organizes documents into a tree-structured index It explicitly defines different...",
