      "children": [],
      "embedding_dim": 2048,
      "text": "(2) Structural isolation: unlike Graph-RAG which dynamically hops between documents based on pairwise relationships, leaf nodes in a tree index lack explicit connections This prevents the retriever from capturing impl...",
