      "embedding_dim": 2048,
      "text": "This work aims to address the limitations of Tree-RAG on cross-document and multi-hop retrieval We present Ψ-RAG, a versatile and effective Tree-RAG framework, comprising a hierarchical abstract tree index and a multi...",
