      "embedding_dim": 2048,
      "text": "• Ψ-RAG extends Tree-RAG to complex multi-hop scenarios To our knowledge, Ψ-RAG is the first Tree-RAG for cross-document multi-hop scenarios comparable to Graph-RAG, exhibiting great application potential As in Figure...",
